## Rule Creation Guidelines

### New Rule Checklist
- [ ] Clear purpose defined
- [ ] Proper categorization
- [ ] YAML frontmatter complete
- [ ] Implementation examples included
- [ ] Integration points documented
- [ ] Testing requirements specified
- [ ] Validation criteria established
- [ ] Dependencies documented
- [ ] Conflicts checked
- [ ] Documentation complete

### Rule Template
```markdown
# Rule Title

---
description: Rule purpose and scope
globs: ["file patterns"]
alwaysApply: boolean
priority: level
---

## Purpose
[Clear description of rule purpose]

## Requirements
- Requirement 1
- Requirement 2
- Requirement 3

## Implementation
```[language]
[Code example]
```

## Integration
- Integration point 1
- Integration point 2

## Testing
- Test requirement 1
- Test requirement 2

## Checklist
- [ ] Item 1
- [ ] Item 2
```

